        complexity: { best: 'one product and one curve reading', avg: 'the law holds well for uniform fields over a wide range', worst: 'it fails for non-uniform fields and for very large gaps where streamers dominate', note: 'The similarity principle it embodies lets a small high-pressure gap model a large low-pressure one.' },
