        complexity: { best: 'a smooth large-radius conductor may never reach inception', avg: 'inception is computed from surface field and air density', worst: 'surface irregularities, dirt and water drops all lower inception unpredictably', note: 'Corona loss rises sharply in foul weather, because water drops act as sharp points.' },
