        complexity: { best: 'a short low-resistance divider responds in tens of nanoseconds', avg: 'one time constant estimate and one loading check', worst: 'at megavolt levels the required low resistance draws very large current', note: 'The response time must be a small fraction of the front time, not merely shorter than it.' },
