        complexity: { best: 'all layers working gives a very low outage rate', avg: 'each layer is designed against the residual of the one before it', worst: 'a single weak layer, usually footing resistance, undermines the whole scheme', note: 'Arrester lead length matters: the inductive drop in a long lead adds to the residual voltage.' },
