        complexity: { best: 'a short cable can be tested at power frequency directly', avg: 'very low frequency reduces charging current by the frequency ratio', worst: 'direct voltage testing can itself damage polymeric insulation by space charge injection', note: 'The location capability is a substantial practical advantage, since a cable defect is otherwise buried.' },
